tellraw @s {"text":"========== Red_Line_Server Rules ==========","color":"red","bold":true}
tellraw @s {"text":"1. No griefing, stealing, or messing with other players’ builds/items.","color":"white"}
tellraw @s {"text":"2. Fully chop trees. No floating trees.","color":"white"}
tellraw @s {"text":"3. Keep shared storage organized.","color":"white"}
tellraw @s {"text":"4. Don’t build too close to someone else’s area without asking.","color":"white"}
tellraw @s {"text":"5. No cheating: x-ray, hacked clients, duping, or exploit abuse.","color":"white"}
tellraw @s {"text":"6. Patch creeper holes and damage near bases, roads, farms, or builds.","color":"white"}
tellraw @s {"text":"7. Replant/reset shared farms after using them.","color":"white"}
tellraw @s {"text":"8. Don’t kill pets, villagers, named mobs, or owned animals.","color":"white"}
tellraw @s {"text":"9. Don’t break nether tunnels, portals, or transport links.","color":"white"}
tellraw @s {"text":"10. Pranks are fine if they’re reversible and don’t destroy stuff.","color":"white"}
